In article <284@sdcc7.UUCP>, ee178acb@sdcc7.UUCP (DARIN JOHNSON) writes:
> I tought that dead lizards were supposed to protect you from a cockatrice.
> Instead, I took 4 rounds to turn to stone.  Any explanations?
> (scroll of remove curse did nothing to stop this, perhaps a
> potion of healing?)
